  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"EntityProjectionIntrospector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector</code></a> given <a href=\"ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>, <a href=\"EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>、<a href=\"EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate</code></a> 以及\n<a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，创建一个新的 <a href=\"EntityProjectionIntrospector.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Introspect a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>mapped type</code></a> in the context of a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domain type</code></a> whether the returned type is a\nprojection and what property paths are participating in the projection.",
      "translation": "在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>域类型</code></a> 的上下文中，内省一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>映射类型</code></a>，以判断返回的类型是否为投影，以及哪些属性路径参与了该投影。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Deeply nested types (e.g. <code>Map&amp;lt;?, List&amp;lt;Person&amp;gt;&amp;gt;</code>) are represented with a property path that uses\nthe unwrapped type and no longer the root domain type <code>D</code>.",
      "translation": "深度嵌套类型（例如 `<code>Map&lt;?, List&lt;Person&gt;&gt;</code>`）使用展开后的类型作为属性路径，而不再使用根域类型 `<code>D</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Nested properties (direct types, within maps, collections) are introspected for nested projections and contain\nproperty paths for closed projections.",
      "translation": "嵌套属性（直接类型、映射和集合中的内部类型）会进行内省以支持嵌套投影，并包含用于封闭投影的属性路径。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Represents a predicate (boolean-valued function) of a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>target type</code></a> and its <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>underlying\ntype</code></a>.",
      "translation": "表示一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>目标类型</code></a>及其<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>底层类型</code></a>的谓词（布尔值函数）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This class introspects the returned type in the context of a domain type for all reachable properties (w/o cycles) to\ndetermine which property paths are subject to projection.",
      "translation": "该类会在域类型的上下文中，对所有可达属性（无循环）进行内省，以确定哪些属性路径适用于投影。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a new <a href=\"EntityProjectionIntrospector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "一个新的<a href=\"EntityProjectionIntrospector.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.projection 中的类\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
